WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.939
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.902
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.903 --> 00:00:27.400
They see a water park.

4
00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:50.748
The blobs jump in the water.

5
00:00:50.749 --> 00:01:11.125
They float in the water.

6
00:01:11.126 --> 00:01:30.833
They surf in the water.

7
00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:54.405
They paddle in the water.

8
00:01:54.406 --> 00:02:19.523
They sail in the water.

9
00:02:19.524 --> 00:02:37.757
They dive in the water.

10
00:02:37.758 --> 00:02:48.213
They swim in the water.

11
00:02:48.214 --> 00:02:51.548
Uh-oh.

12
00:02:51.549 --> 00:02:58.089
Is that a shark, blobs?

13
00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:02.924
No, it's just a toy.

14
00:03:02.925 --> 00:03:05.822
Silly blobs!

15
00:03:05.823 --> 00:03:07.962
Good-bye!

